### Get all contacts
GET https://localhost:5001/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

###

### Get contact by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/contacts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Add new contact
POST https://localhost:5001/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shreya",
  "email": "shreya@gmail.com",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

###

### Update contact
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Updated",
  "email": "updated@gmail.com",
  "phone": "9999999999"
}

###

### Delete contact
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/contacts/1